{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_010_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:016e6b1870696be9fbea3525e4006d357cb3c58f0d19af137167087f55810116",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8291adf1697502fac1eea6f477601d1f6fd449a4700cc3a4a7cce5894755f6e9",
      "text": "带着笑容Shall we dance",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2329f651bd4f1f2600d71d834d2729316654ee9a43ca83c37d0d9e8272332fd6",
      "text": "经制作人的推荐，皮埃尔决定参加\n电视剧的试镜。\n试镜的结果是他拿下的角色，\n竟然是导演他们从皮埃尔的演技中获得灵感而设计的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8291adf1697502fac1eea6f477601d1f6fd449a4700cc3a4a7cce5894755f6e9",
      "text": "带着笑容Shall we dance",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4769a183de9693bf90817df8a0f67e192919af51bac3d11a413a078522d9a838",
      "text": "（电视剧的试镜吗。\n如果是这个题材的话……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b6f03b41d9fb5e150cda158ffe3b851619832c644893840cffb2bd997404f72",
      "text": "啊，皮埃尔先生！\n现在方便打扰一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6047156ec9498e092af6bdadff105b6934a086a0fe4320d3c8d1ef70bf6f666",
      "text": "可以哦！\n●●●●プロデューサー，怎么啦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d92f3a66fe1a9c0a61568418907633031ca97014347dc4ccba2ffcda709f518",
      "text": "听说皮埃尔先生有着相当于\n剑道五段的实力呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d17d5d1c80be703f5f9ebfd2fd7cdca4be0b972a9a8c3b29b74fdf81155ce54d",
      "text": "有一部以击剑为题材的电视剧。\n想不想去参加试镜试试看？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88ac331ac3fd773860860aeb34321eef4a575ea3c16bff842039eb68ea4b8d4d",
      "text": "击剑！\n我也会击剑哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4e6b6a4966fac5f6939e9cddb383b83c9dbc5bcbb3c4863ea6cebc9023a1260",
      "text": "咦，真的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90b66f8818a61a9aa83a2609066cb06a6170bcdfa00f55048a092511d44c56a1",
      "text": "嗯！Êtes-vous prêts！Oui！Allez！\n击剑，在老家学过！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:344c19c0e75bd9850897d0693eadd009120c538df5e97d11783721fdb9e28307",
      "text": "我，想成为更加更加了不起的偶像！\n所以，试镜，要去参加！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f870705300454825f4c333778a3c2399e2807210f28a476998747f4d207282c4",
      "text": "绝对要合格！加油、加油，哦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
